              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বোনা (bonā) is a tadbhava, a word inherited and reshaped by sound change. It comes from vunāti, \"weaves\", a form CDIAL reconstructs from its descendants (CDIAL 11773). CDIAL writes the Bengali verb bunā."
